### 프로필 이미지 업로드
POST http://13.124.234.198:8080/api/members/1/profile-image
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="postman test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpg

< ./postman%20test.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--


### 프로필 이미지 URL 조회
GET http://13.124.234.198:8080/api/members/1/profile-image